{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 15 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图神经网络：当边、拓扑和关系本身就是医学信息</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Graph &amp; Mesh Networks</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_075_gcn-title\">GCN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以加自环的对称归一化邻接执行共享线性变换后的固定权重邻居聚合。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">First-order spectral graph convolution approximation that aggregates 1-hop neighbor features weighted by the symmetrically normalized adjacency matrix with self-loops.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图 G=(V,E)、节点特征 X 与邻接矩阵 A</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Graph G=(V,E) with node feature matrix X ∈ R^{N×C} and adjacency matrix A</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">节点级或图级预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Updated node embeddings H^{(L)} for node classification, link prediction, or pooled graph classification</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.02907\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_075_gcn')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_075_gcn')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GCN original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/2ea4cff0ceeb601d1b18.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_075_gcn\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_075_gcn')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_075_gcn\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图与特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">节点特征 X、邻接 A；边定义允许的信息传递范围</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests graph g=(v,e) with node feature matrix x ∈ r^{n×c} and adjacency matrix a and prepares initial tensor representations (feature).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"节点特征 X、邻接 A；边定义允许的信息传递范围\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests graph g=(v,e) with node feature matrix x ∈ r^{n×c} and adjacency matrix a and prepares initial tensor representations (feature).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"图与特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图与特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节点特征 X、邻接 A；边定义允许的信息传递范围</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests graph g=(v,e) with node feature matrix x ∈ r^{n×c} and adjacency matrix a and prepares initial tensor representations (feature).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"A_tilde=A+I，使节点保留自身特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"加入自环\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">加入自环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">A_tilde=A+I，使节点保留自身特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"D_tilde^{-1/2} A_tilde D_tilde^{-1/2} 稳定不同度数的聚合\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Normalized Adjacency within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"归一化邻接\" data-node-name-en=\"Normalized Adjacency\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">归一化邻接</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Normalized Adjacency</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">D_tilde^{-1/2} A_tilde D_tilde^{-1/2} 稳定不同度数的聚合</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Normalized Adjacency within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"H^l W^l 把节点特征映射到新通道\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"线性变换\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">线性变换</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">H^l W^l 把节点特征映射到新通道</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按归一化邻接对一跳邻居做加权求和\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Neighborhood Aggregation within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"邻居聚合\" data-node-name-en=\"Neighborhood Aggregation\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">邻居聚合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Neighborhood Aggregation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按归一化邻接对一跳邻居做加权求和</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Neighborhood Aggregation within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"sigma 后得到 H^{l+1}；L 层覆盖 L-hop 邻域\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 06 within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"激活 / 堆叠\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">激活 / 堆叠</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">sigma 后得到 H^{l+1}；L 层覆盖 L-hop 邻域</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 06 within the core normalized graph convolution computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"节点分类头或 pooling 后的图级分类头\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 07 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"任务读出\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务读出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节点分类头或 pooling 后的图级分类头</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 07 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"节点标签、图标签或连续值\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces updated node embeddings h^{(l)} for node classification, link prediction, or pooled graph classification via prediction.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"预测\" data-node-name-en=\"prediction\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_075_gcn', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预测</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节点标签、图标签或连续值</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces updated node embeddings h^{(l)} for node classification, link prediction, or pooled graph classification via prediction.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GCN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 对称归一化图卷积更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Symmetrically Normalized Adjacency Propagation: H^{(l+1)} = σ(D̃^{-1/2} Ã D̃^{-1/2} H^{(l)} W^{(l)})</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GCN：核心公式 · 对称归一化图卷积更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"75\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.831587 -69.00913 207.007377 17.865756\" width=\"207.007377pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.597937 0V-.158807C5.032188-.208434 4.96271-.287837 4.843605-1.012393L3.910615-6.63018H3.652554L.774183-1.667471C-.009925-.34739-.10918-.23821-.506196-.158807V0H1.349857V-.158807C.843661-.208434 .764257-.258061 .764257-.506196C.764257-.694779 .794034-.784108 .962766-1.121572L1.528515-2.243145H3.712107L3.910615-.942915C3.920541-.853586 3.930466-.764257 3.930466-.684854C3.930466-.307688 3.79151-.218359 3.156283-.158807V0H5.597937ZM3.66248-2.60046H1.736948L3.225761-5.181069L3.66248-2.60046Z\" id=\"m075_g16-22\"></path><path d=\"M6.947794-3.811361C6.947794-5.43913 5.816296-6.481299 4.0495