\" id=\"m075_g4-17\"></path></defs><g id=\"m075_page1\"><use x=\"-68.752183\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-29\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"-60.419437\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-185\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"-57.663078\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g13-18\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"-53.81217\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-184\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"-49.186716\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g20-49\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"-45.186713\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-186\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"-38.917671\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g1-61\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"-29.684593\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-102\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"-21.754326\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g4-16\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"-14.770533\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g23-126\" y=\"-59.472003\"></use><use x=\"-17.639776\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-25\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"-9.558077\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-0\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"-4.641721\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g20-49\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"-1.005356\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-157\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"2.3401\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g20-50\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"9.40357\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g23-126\" y=\"-59.686211\"></use><use x=\"7.221763\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-22\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"16.676285\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g23-126\" y=\"-59.472003\"></use><use x=\"13.807042\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-25\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"21.888741\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-0\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"26.805096\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g20-49\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"30.441461\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-157\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"33.786917\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g20-50\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"38.180413\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-29\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"46.51316\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-185\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"49.269518\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g13-18\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"53.484064\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-186\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"56.72676\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-44\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"66.494118\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-185\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"69.250477\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g13-18\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"73.465022\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g7-186\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"77.166005\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g4-17\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"83.170082\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-150\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"100.322359\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g23-126\" y=\"-59.686211\"></use><use x=\"98.140552\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-22\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"107.124549\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g1-61\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"116.975314\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-22\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"125.405855\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g10-184\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"134.364429\" xlink:href=\"#m075_g16-30\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">谱图卷积需特征分解，难扩展且参数不易共享</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Exact spectral graph CNNs required O(N³) Laplacian eigendecomposition and could not transfer across graphs of varying topology.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用归一化邻接矩阵的一阶谱近似做邻居特征聚合</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Truncate Chebyshev spectral polynomials to first order, yielding a localized spatial 1-hop neighborhood averaging operator with shared linear weights.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">局部 message passing 的简单可训练形式</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Simple, parameter-efficient message passing scaling linearly with number of graph edges O(|E|).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于 population graph、血管/气道树和解剖 mesh</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational GNN used across brain connectomes (fMRI/DTI), vascular/airway trees, cortical surface meshes, and spatial cell graphs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">GNN 基础；深层 over-smoothing 与构图泄漏需警惕</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core GNN baseline; stacking many GCN layers causes over-smoothing, and transductive patient-similarity graphs risk severe cohort leakage.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">用一阶谱近似得到局部 message passing，不需要图拉普拉斯特征分解。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">对称度归一化控制高度节点的消息尺度，自环保留自身信息。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">邻接矩阵决定信息泄漏边界；多层堆叠会引起 over-smoothing 和 oversquashing。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Truncate Chebyshev spectral polynomials to first order, yielding a localized spatial 1-hop neighborhood averaging operator with shared linear weights.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Simple, parameter-efficient message passing scaling linearly with number of graph edges O(|E|).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Symmetrically Normalized Adjacency Propagation: H^{(l+1)} = σ(D̃^{-1/2} Ã D̃^{-1/2} H^{(l)} W^{(l)}).</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可用于病人 population graph、血管/气道树、细胞图和解剖 mesh 的节点或图级任务。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">若边由结局相关变量、医院 ID 或全数据统计构造，可能发生验证集泄漏；构图必须在 split 内完成。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Foundational GNN used across brain connectomes (fMRI/DTI), vascular/airway trees, cortical surface meshes, and spatial cell graphs.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Core GNN baseline; stacking many GCN layers causes over-smoothing, and transductive patient-similarity graphs risk severe cohort leakage.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.02907\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Semi-Supervised Classification with Graph Convolutional Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/tkipf/gcn\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}